Z||000007||WKDFIRO||05-08-2000||04:04 AM||||Fast speed! Light body! Left and right Fiero destruction and death! LOL!!! <P>Okay I'll take them one at a time....<P>Fast speed - at a top speed of around 105 for the 4 cyl and 125 mph for the V6 even for the time was not blindingly fast.<P>Light body - The MR-2 and CRX were much lighter than the Fiero's steel space frame chassis.<P>Which brings us to Safety. More Camaro drivers get killed than Fieros. Fieros came out with the Saturn's plastic over space frame first. You could not beat the Fiero with its crashworthiness with anything in its class!<P>Yikes, sounds like your source has been reading what is on the general internet and not enough from people who know Fieros!||||reg||10
